---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SOCIAL } from '../consts.ts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Imran Ahamed — applied AI/ML engineer, co-founder at VEZRAN, ex-Starbucks, ex-FedEx."
>
  <article class="prose-essay">
    <h1 class="text-[34px] font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">About</h1>

    <p>
      I build applied AI/ML systems. Started in 2014 on banking data engineering at TCS; the last 8+ years have been
      production ML — first at FedEx, then Starbucks, now co-founding VEZRAN.
    </p>

    <h2>What I focus on</h2>
    <p>
      Multi-agent systems and RAG pipelines that survive contact with production. Agent orchestration on frontier
      LLMs (Claude, GPT-4o, Gemini), eval design when ground truth is incomplete, and the unglamorous infrastructure
      — latency, cost, fallback paths — that decides whether agents actually ship.
    </p>

    <h2>What I&rsquo;m building now</h2>
    <p>
      Co-founder and Head of AI/ML at <a href={SOCIAL.vezran} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">VEZRAN</a>.
      We&rsquo;re shipping <strong>Zyberpol</strong>, an agentic SOC platform with four working agents — Correlation,
      Investigation, Triage, Remediation — sitting on top of CrowdStrike, Okta, Splunk, and AWS. The differentiator:
      signed, audit-ready evidence for every action. Pre-seed, hiring.
    </p>

    <h2>What I shipped before</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Starbucks — Senior Data Scientist, People Analytics (2022–2025).</strong> Turnover prediction and
        headcount forecasting models across the US retail footprint. BERT/T5 NLP on contact-center data: topic
        modeling, summarization, semantic search.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>FedEx — Senior Data Scientist (2018–2022).</strong> Package-at-risk and loss-intensity models in
        production on Azure across the logistics network. GDPR-compliant data matching at 95% retrieval. Fraud
        detection across shipping patterns.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>TCS — Systems / Data Engineer (2011–2014).</strong> Banking application engineering and
        automation work in Bengaluru.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Stack</h2>
    <p>
      Python, PyTorch, Transformers, LangChain / LangGraph, Azure ML, Databricks, MLflow, Ragas, Phoenix, Tableau.
    </p>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>MS, Business Analytics — The University of Texas at Dallas (2016–2017)</li>
      <li>BE, Information Science &amp; Engineering — NMAM Institute of Technology, NITTE (2007–2011)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={SOCIAL.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={SOCIAL.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href={SOCIAL.scholar} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar</a></li>
      <li><a href={SOCIAL.email}>Email</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
